  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.02 Applicability. The fees in this part shall apply to any applicant who is required by applicable law, in order to be eligible for licensure, to pass an examination that is administered by a third party testing organization with whom the OPLC has contracted to administer the exam.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35",
